;====
:====
# An activation flip raises the domains of the style's properties that are declared on the node or
# differ from their initial values, not those of every property the style holds: authoring only the
# paint property of a style that also holds a parent-layout property flips the style active and
# raises paint on the node and nothing on its parent.

/core/style
/core/style-debug
/core/markup
/core/tests/support/markup-fixtures

<BatchDemo demo
    <Probe

demo.markup-batch-queue.checkpoint()

. probe = demo.%first-child! as Probe
probe.reset()
style-author-dynamic(probe, style-info-named("Frame")!, 0, StyleLayer.inline, 99, -1, 7, false)
demo.markup-batch-queue.checkpoint()
-- style-activation-snapshot(probe)
-- probe.report

